<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Forgetting all that I’m outwardly doing.</l><l>Forgetting all of my thoughts of improving.</l><l>You only want to be loved,</l><l>I give my love unto You;</l><l>A crazy lover of Christ, I’m jumping for joy.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Yes, my life’s just to love You with my whole being.</l><l>Yes, my work’s just to love You with my whole being.</l><l>Loving You is my pleasure,</l><l>Loving You is my service,</l><l>Loving You is my motive and also my will.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O my Love, You’ve blinded me towards all things.</l><l>O my Love, You make the world simply nothing.</l><l>Just let me see You alone,</l><l>Just make me need You alone;</l><l>None other is there for me, it’s Jesus alone!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
